# Vercel builds ONLY the Next.js app. The repo also carries the Anchor/Rust
# workspace, whose target/ alone is 3.2GB — uploading it blows past Vercel's
# 15,000-file limit and kills the connection mid-transfer.
#
# The app imports exactly three paths out of vsol/, verified by grep:
#   vsol/sdk, vsol/deployments/devnet.json, vsol/target/idl/vsol.json
# Everything heavy is excluded explicitly below rather than via ignore-file
# negation, which is fragile and silently failed here once already.

node_modules
.next
.git
vsol/node_modules
vsol/programs
vsol/tests
vsol/.anchor
vsol/.devnet
vsol/target/debug
vsol/target/release
vsol/target/deploy
vsol/target/sbpf-solana-solana
vsol/target/tmp
vsol/target/bpfel-unknown-unknown
vsol/target/.rustc_info.json
vsol/target/CACHEDIR.TAG

web
worker
artifacts
cache
.wrangler
examples
*.so
*.rlib
